<section class="ex-note" id="approach">
<h2>1. Approach to the Patient（問診與身體檢查）</h2>
<h3>History（病史）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Dermatology 是視覺專科，some skin conditions may be diagnosed at a glance；但複雜病例（如 rash 合併 fever、generalized pruritus）病史可能是關鍵。<span class="ex-ref">p.1</span></li>
<li>實務上 many dermatologists 先簡短問診、做身體檢查，再依檢查所提示的鑑別診斷做更詳細的詢問。<span class="ex-ref">p.1–2</span></li>
<li>新皮膚問題：primary goal 是建立診斷，secondary goal 是評估是否適合治療；已確診者則重新評估原診斷、追蹤病程與併發症、調整治療。<span class="ex-ref">p.2</span></li>
<li>Table 1-1 重點：HPI 包括 duration、timing、evolution、location、symptoms、severity（pain 或 pruritus 以 <strong class="ex-n">10-point scale</strong> 評分以便追蹤）、ameliorating／exacerbating factors、先前疾病與新藥物、已試過的治療；Medication history 要特別注意 recently started 的藥物；另含 allergies、social history（含 sexual history、travel）、family history（skin disease、atopy、skin cancer）、review of systems。<span class="ex-ref">p.2</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Complete cutaneous examination（完整皮膚檢查）</h3>
<ul>
<li>範圍：全身皮膚，包括 often-overlooked areas（scalp、eyelids、ears、genitals、buttocks、perineum、interdigital spaces）；hair；nails；eyes、nose、mouth、genitals、anus 的 mucous membranes。<span class="ex-ref">p.2</span></li>
<li>單一 wart 或 acne 這類 highly focused complaint，日常實務 may not require 全身檢查。<span class="ex-ref">p.2</span></li>
<li>好處：發現 skin cancers 等潛在有害病灶、對良性發現給予安心、找到額外診斷線索（例如 lichen planus 的 buccal mucosa <strong>Wickham striae</strong>）、衛教機會（lentigines 代表 sun damage）。<span class="ex-ref">p.2</span></li>
<li>理想條件：excellent lighting（preferably bright, natural light）最重要；病人完全脫衣，移除 underwear、socks、shoes、makeup、eyeglasses；異性醫病時 may be required chaperone。<span class="ex-ref">p.2–3</span></li>
<li>建議工具（眼與手是唯一必要工具，以下 often useful）：loupe／dermatoscope、penlight、glass slides（diascopy、viral DFA、fungal scrapings、Tzanck、scabies prep）、alcohol pads、gloves、ruler、<strong>No. 15</strong>（scraping）與 <strong>No. 11</strong>（incising）scalpel blades、KOH 等 diagnostic solutions、camera、<strong>Wood lamp（<strong class="ex-n">365 nm</strong>）</strong>凸顯細微色素變化。<span class="ex-ref">p.3</span></li>
<li>技巧：先遠觀整體印象（asymmetry、cachexia、jaundice），再 usually from head to toe 系統性檢查、一次只露出一區；sometimes side lighting 最能顯示深度與邊界；palpate 判斷 soft、firm、tender、fluid-filled；pigmented lesions 用 dermatoscope。<span class="ex-ref">p.3</span></li>
<li>要切片的疑似惡性病灶，以 photography 與依解剖標記的 <strong>triangulation</strong> 記錄位置，以便日後找到確切位置並 definitively treated。<span class="ex-ref">p.3</span></li>
<li>Table 1-2 重點（physical examination）：general impression（well or ill、obese／cachectic、skin color 含 pallor 與 jaundice、skin temperature、xerosis／seborrhea／turgor／hyper- 或 hypohidrosis 等表面特徵、degree of photoaging）；morphology 依序描述 primary lesion、color／texture、secondary changes、shape／configuration、distribution；may be helpful 的一般身體檢查：vital signs、hepatosplenomegaly、pulses、lymph node examination（especially 疑似 infection 與 malignancy）。<span class="ex-ref">p.3</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="primary-morphology">
<h2>2. Primary Morphology（原發性病灶）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Primary lesion 與 secondary change 是 morphology 的「letters」；primary morphology 描述 <strong>size、topography、contents</strong> 三項，是其他「adjectives」（color、shape、size、texture）所修飾的「noun」。<span class="ex-ref">p.3–4</span></li>
<li>Clinical–pathologic correlation：flat-topped／planar papules 與 plaques tend to 是侵犯 epidermis 與 superficial dermis 的過程；dome-shaped 或 nodular lesions often 有較深的 dermis／subcutis 浸潤；scaling 或 crusting 表示 epidermis 受影響，表面平滑完整的可觸摸病灶反映 purely dermal 或 subcutaneous 過程。<span class="ex-ref">p.3–4</span></li>
<li>各教科書定義有差異：例如 papule 曾被描述為 no greater than 1 cm、no less than 0.5 cm、或從 pinhead 到 split pea 大小；本章作者選擇降低主觀性的定義。<span class="ex-ref">p.4</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Primary lesion</th><th scope="col">Size</th><th scope="col">Topography</th><th scope="col">Contents</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Macule</td><td><strong class="ex-n">&lt;1 cm</strong></td><td>Flat</td><td>N/A（color change only）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Patch</td><td><strong class="ex-n">≥1 cm</strong></td><td>Flat</td><td>N/A（color change only）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Papule</td><td><strong class="ex-n">&lt;1 cm</strong></td><td>Raised/Depressed</td><td>Solid</td></tr>
<tr><td>Plaque</td><td><strong class="ex-n">≥1 cm</strong></td><td>Raised/Depressed</td><td>Solid</td></tr>
<tr><td>Nodule</td><td><strong class="ex-n">≥1 cm</strong></td><td>Raised</td><td>Solid or fluid</td></tr>
<tr><td>Vesicle</td><td><strong class="ex-n">&lt;1 cm</strong></td><td>Raised</td><td>Fluid（serum, blood, lymph）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bulla</td><td><strong class="ex-n">≥1 cm</strong></td><td>Raised</td><td>Fluid（serum, blood, lymph）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pustule</td><td><strong class="ex-n">&lt;1 cm</strong></td><td>Raised</td><td>Fluid（pus）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Erosion</td><td>Any</td><td>Depressed</td><td>N/A</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ulceration</td><td>Any</td><td>Depressed</td><td>N/A</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 1-3，p.4。Erosions 與 ulcerations 可為 primary 或 secondary，p.4。</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Macule／patch</strong>：平的、不可觸摸，只是顏色不同。<span class="ex-ref">p.4</span></li>
<li><strong>Papule</strong>：elevated 或 depressed、may be solid or cystic；topography 可描述為 sessile、pedunculated、dome-shaped、flat-topped、filiform、mammillated、acuminate（conical）、umbilicated。<span class="ex-ref">p.4</span></li>
<li><strong>Plaque</strong>：solid plateau-like elevation 或 depression，直徑 ≥1 cm。<span class="ex-ref">p.5</span></li>
<li><strong>Nodule</strong>：內文寫 palpable lesion greater than 1 cm，domed、spherical 或 ovoid，may be solid or cystic；依主要侵犯構造分 <strong class="ex-n">5</strong> 型：epidermal、epidermal–dermal、dermal、dermal–subdermal、subcutaneous；texture（firm、soft、boggy、fluctuant）與表面（smooth、keratotic、ulcerated、fungating）有助鑑別。<em>Tumor</em> 有時歸在 nodule 下，可指形狀較不規則的腫塊（良性或惡性）。<span class="ex-ref">p.5</span></li>
<li><strong>Vesicle／bulla</strong>：by definition 壁薄而透明可看見內容物，內容物 may be clear、serous 或 hemorrhagic；裂隙可在 intraepidermal 或 subepidermal（sometimes extending into the dermis）。Tenseness 或 flaccidity may help 判斷裂隙深度，但可靠區分需要 blister edge 的病理檢查。<span class="ex-ref">p.5</span></li>
<li><strong>Pustule</strong>：位於 epidermis 或 infundibulum、含可見膿液的隆起 papule；exudate may contain organisms 或 may be sterile；in certain situations may 融合成「lakes」of pus；與毛囊相關時 may appear conical、中央有毛髮。<span class="ex-ref">p.5</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Table 1-3 的 nodule 寫 ≥1 cm，內文寫 greater than 1 cm。<span class="ex-ref">p.4–5</span>Vesicle／bulla 的 tense 或 flaccid 只 may help 判斷深度，可靠區分要靠 blister edge 的病理。<span class="ex-ref">p.5</span></aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="secondary-change">
<h2>3. Secondary Change（續發性表面變化）</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Scale</strong>：表示 epidermis（usually stratum corneum）改變的肉眼所見。<span class="ex-ref">p.6</span></li>
<li><strong>Crust</strong>：serum、blood、pus 乾掉。圓形或橢圓 crust 指向先前的 vesicle、bulla 或 pustule；linear 或 angulated crust 表示 excoriation。<strong>Eschar</strong>：乾、附著、dark red-purple／brown／black，代表 skin necrosis；<strong>fibrin</strong>：some ulcers 表面柔軟的黃色 crust。<span class="ex-ref">p.6</span></li>
<li><strong>Lichenification</strong>：反覆搓抓造成皮膚增厚、皮紋加深，主要見於 chronic eczematous 或 neurogenic processes。<span class="ex-ref">p.6</span></li>
<li><strong>Atrophy</strong>：epidermal atrophy 呈發亮、「cigarette-paper」wrinkling；dermal atrophy 造成凹陷病灶。<span class="ex-ref">p.6</span></li>
<li><strong>Fissure</strong>：張力過大或彈性下降造成的線狀斷裂，frequently 發生在 stratum corneum 厚而最不能延展的 palms 與 soles。<span class="ex-ref">p.6–7</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Type of scale</th><th scope="col">Description（描述）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Craquelé/xerotic</td><td>乾裂外觀；hyperkeratosis 合併 fissuring，像乾涸河床</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cutaneous horn</td><td>Compact stratum corneum 形成的圓錐狀突起</td></tr>
<tr><td>Exfoliative/desquamative</td><td>以細屑或整片剝落</td></tr>
<tr><td>Follicular</td><td>Keratotic plugs、spines 或 filaments</td></tr>
<tr><td>Gritty</td><td>緊密附著、砂紙觸感</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ichthyosiform</td><td>規則多角形板狀，平行排列或菱形（fish-like、tessellated）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Keratotic/hyperkeratotic</td><td>厚、緻密、附著的角質層</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lamellar</td><td>大而薄的板狀，中央附著、邊緣較鬆</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pityriasiform</td><td>Small and branny</td></tr>
<tr><td>Psoriasiform（micaceous and ostraceous）</td><td>Silvery、brittle，像 mica 的多層薄片（micaceous）；大片鱗屑 may 堆積成堆，似牡蠣殼（ostraceous）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Seborrheic</td><td>厚、waxy 或 greasy、yellow-to-brown flakes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Shellac-like</td><td>發亮，邊緣片狀脫落，像剝落的油漆</td></tr>
<tr><td>Wickham striae</td><td>Violaceous flat-topped papules 上的 lacy white pattern</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 1-4，p.6。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="color">
<h2>4. Color（顏色）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Perhaps the most important 的 primary morphology 以外特徵是 color；最常見的是 brown（hyperpigmentation）與 red（erythema）。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Brown（棕色）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Most often 代表 melanin；less frequently 也可能（may）來自 hemosiderin、amyloid、mucin 沉積或 granulomatous、histiocytic、plasmacytic、mixed inflammation。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
<li>Mast cells 誘導上方表皮產生 melanin，often 在 dermal mast cell 病灶上方呈棕色。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
<li>Epidermal melanin：tan 到 muddy brown；非常集中時（some nevi、melanomas、heavily pigmented seborrheic keratoses）may appear brown-black。Dermal melanin may appear brown、gray 或 blue。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
<li><strong>Tyndall effect</strong>：真皮中懸浮的色素造成 preferential transmission of longer wavelengths（blue photospectrum），呈 gray-blue；dermal 的 oxidized keratin（如 infundibular cyst）與 tattoo 也可出現。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
<li><strong>Wood lamp</strong> accentuates epidermal 但不 accentuate dermal melanin，可協助區分。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
<li>表皮發炎或受傷時 melanin often 掉入真皮，因此 many subacute、chronic 或剛消退的表皮發炎呈 brown 或 gray-brown；constitutive pigment 越多越明顯。<span class="ex-ref">p.7</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Red（紅色，erythema）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Pale red、pink、purple may 來自 hyperemia；更飽和的紅到紫 can indicate intense hyperemia 或 vascular congestion（rubor，如 erysipelas）；再更飽和可來自 malformed／ectopic vessels 或 extravasated erythrocytes（petechiae、purpura）。<span class="ex-ref">p.7–8</span></li>
<li>True red often 與 neutrophilic inflammation 相關（cellulitis、Sweet syndrome）；red-purple（violaceous）則（often）與 lymphocytic inflammation 相關（lymphoma cutis、connective tissue disease、lichen planus 等 interface reactions）。<span class="ex-ref">p.9</span></li>
<li>Granulomatous inflammation may appear red-brown（<mark data-q="105-35">sarcoidosis 的經典「apple jelly」色</mark>、juvenile xanthogranuloma）到 orange 或 yellow（necrobiosis lipoidica）。<span class="ex-ref">p.9</span></li>
<li>Caveat：erythema 的真正色調在 fair skin 的急性病灶最容易看；subacute／chronic 病灶（particularly 有表皮侵犯者）因表皮色素掉入真皮而偏 brown 或 gray；hemorrhage 也可（can）使病灶偏 purple。<span class="ex-ref">p.9</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Color</th><th scope="col">Pathology（病理）</th><th scope="col">Diagnostic examples（例子）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>White</td><td>Reduced/absent melanin synthesis；keratin；calcium deposit；scar</td><td>Tinea versicolor、vitiligo；milium；calcinosis cutis；atrophie blanche</td></tr>
<tr><td>Black</td><td>Dense melanin；intraepidermal hemorrhage；necrosis；oxidized keratin（brown to black）</td><td>Melanoma；talon noir；cutaneous anthrax；open comedone</td></tr>
<tr><td>Brown</td><td>Melanin</td><td>Melanocytic nevus、melasma</td></tr>
<tr><td>Red-brown</td><td>Hemosiderin（「cayenne pepper」）；<mark data-q="105-35">granulomatous inflammation（「apple jelly」）</mark>；histiocytic；mixed；plasmacytic（「copper」或「ham」）；mast cell；mucin；amyloid；smooth muscle；subacute/chronic epidermal inflammation</td><td>Pigmented purpuric dermatosis；<mark data-q="105-35">sarcoidosis</mark>；Langerhans cell histiocytosis；granuloma faciale；secondary syphilis；urticaria pigmentosa；pretibial myxedema；lichen amyloidosis；cutaneous leiomyoma；subacute lupus erythematosus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Red</td><td>Vascular dilation/congestion；neutrophilic inflammation；vascular neoplasm</td><td>Erysipelas；Sweet syndrome；cherry angioma</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pink or salmon</td><td>Acute inflammation with dilation of superficial dermal vessels</td><td>Eczema、drug eruptions、urticaria、pityriasis rubra pilaris、psoriasis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Orange</td><td>Granulomatous inflammation with histiocytes having abundant cytoplasm</td><td>Juvenile xanthogranuloma</td></tr>
<tr><td>Yellow</td><td>Pus；lipid；histiocytic inflammation；elastolysis；sebaceous glands；bilirubin</td><td>Folliculitis；xanthelasma；necrobiosis lipoidica；pseudoxanthoma elasticum；sebaceous hyperplasia；jaundice</td></tr>
<tr><td>Green</td><td>Deep hemosiderin；pyocyanin pigment；myeloperoxidase；tissue eosinophilia</td><td>Ecchymosis；<em>Pseudomonas</em> infection；chloroma；Wells syndrome</td></tr>
<tr><td>Blue/gray</td><td>Deep dermal melanin；deep deposition of other pigment</td><td>Blue nevus；argyria、tattoo</td></tr>
<tr><td>Violet to lilac</td><td>Acute lymphocytic inflammation with dilation of deep dermal blood vessels</td><td>Borders of evolving morphea、dermatomyositis、lichen planus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Plum</td><td>Vascular neoplasm；dense lymphocytic inflammation；malignant neoplasm；hemorrhage</td><td>Kaposi sarcoma；lymphoma cutis；nodular amelanotic melanoma；ecchymosis</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 1-5，p.8（各列 pathology 與 example 依分號順序對應）。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="shape-configuration">
<h2>5. Shape &amp; Configuration（形狀與排列）</h2>
<p>「Shape」描述單一 macule／patch／papule／plaque；「configuration」是多個 primary lesions 彼此排列成的形狀；demarcation 指邊緣是否清楚。<span class="ex-ref">p.9</span></p>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Term</th><th scope="col">Definition（定義）</th><th scope="col">Examples（例子）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Annular</td><td>Ring-shaped；leading edge 的顏色或質地變化比中央明顯</td><td>Granuloma annulare、tinea corporis、erythema annulare centrifugum</td></tr>
<tr><td>Round/Nummular/Discoid</td><td>Coin-shaped，實心圓或橢圓，usually 從邊緣到中央型態一致</td><td>Nummular eczema、plaque-type psoriasis、discoid lupus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Arcuate</td><td>Arc-shaped；often 是 annular lesion 未完全形成</td><td>Urticaria、SCLE</td></tr>
<tr><td>Linear</td><td>直線；often 暗示 external contactant 或抓後的 Koebner phenomenon</td><td>Scabies burrow、poison ivy dermatitis、bleomycin pigmentation；多病灶排列如 lichen nitidus、lichen planus</td></tr>
<tr><td>Geographic</td><td>像陸塊，邊緣似海岸線</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>Reticular/Retiform</td><td>Net-like 或 lacy，間隔皮膚不受影響</td><td>Livedo reticularis、cutis marmorata</td></tr>
<tr><td>Stellate</td><td>多個角狀邊緣，像星形</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>Serpiginous</td><td>Serpentine、snake-like</td><td>Cutaneous larva migrans</td></tr>
<tr><td>Targetoid</td><td>中央比周邊深</td><td>見下</td></tr>
<tr><td>Whorled</td><td>像 marble cake，兩種顏色呈波浪交錯；usually 見於 mosaic disorders</td><td>Incontinentia pigmenti、hypomelanosis of Ito、linear and whorled nevoid hypermelanosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Grouped/Herpetiform</td><td>聚集成群</td><td>HSV reactivation（紅斑底上成群 vesicles）、certain arthropod bites</td></tr>
<tr><td>Scattered</td><td>稀疏、不規則分布</td><td>—</td></tr>
<tr><td>Polycyclic</td><td>由融合的圓、環或不完整環組成</td><td>Urticaria、SCLE</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.9–11。</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Typical target</strong>（e.g. erythema multiforme）有 <strong class="ex-n">3</strong> zones：dark red-purple 或 dusky center、較淡的 pink zone、外圈較深的 erythema。<strong>Atypical target</strong> 只有 <strong class="ex-n">2</strong> zones：dark／dusky center 加較淡的 pink rim。<span class="ex-ref">p.10</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Typical 與 atypical target 的中央都比外圈深；若中央比外圈淡，應稱為「annular」。<span class="ex-ref">p.10</span></aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="distribution">
<h2>6. Distribution（分布）</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Distribution</th><th scope="col">Definition / examples（定義與例子）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Dermatomal/Zosteriform</td><td>單側、沿單一 spinal afferent nerve root；classic example 為 herpes zoster</td></tr>
<tr><td>Blaschkoid</td><td>沿胚胎期皮膚細胞遷移線；四肢 generally 縱向、軀幹環狀，curvilinear 而非完全直線；暗示 mosaic disorder（incontinentia pigmenti、ILVEN）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Lymphangitic</td><td>沿淋巴管；implies 感染源由 acral site 往中央擴散；usually 為 staphylococcal 或 streptococcal cellulitis 的紅色條紋</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sporotrichoid</td><td>個別 papules 或 nodules 沿淋巴網分布，suggests 特定的感染鑑別</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sun exposed/Photodistributed</td><td>Face、dorsal hands、V-neck 胸前三角區（photodermatitis、SCLE、PMLE、SCC）；photo-accentuated 指日曬處病灶較密</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sun protected</td><td>衣物遮蔽處；usually 是日曬會改善的皮膚病（parapsoriasis、mycosis fungoides）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Acral</td><td>Hands、feet、wrists、ankles、ears、penis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Extensor</td><td>Dorsal extremities、knees、elbows（psoriasis 為 classic example）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Flexor</td><td>Antecubital、popliteal fossae（childhood atopic dermatitis）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Intertriginous</td><td>皮膚皺褶（axillae、inguinal folds、inner thighs、inframammary、abdominal pannus 下）；often 與濕熱相關</td></tr>
<tr><td>Seborrheic</td><td>偏好 hair-bearing 部位（scalp、eyebrows、beard、central chest、axillae、genitals），also often 偏好 nasolabial 與 postauricular creases</td></tr>
<tr><td>Follicular</td><td>以毛囊為中心的 papules</td></tr>
<tr><td>Generalized</td><td>廣泛；廣泛的發炎性（紅色）病灶稱 <strong>exanthem</strong>（rash）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Universal</td><td>侵犯全身皮膚（erythroderma、alopecia universalis）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.11–12。另有 localized、truncal、bilateral symmetric 等描述，p.11–12。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="diagnostic-signs">
<h2>7. Cutaneous Diagnostic Signs（皮膚診斷徵象）</h2>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Sign</th><th scope="col">Description（操作與表現）</th><th scope="col">Significance（意義）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><mark data-q="105-35">Apple-jelly sign</mark></td><td><mark data-q="105-35">以 glass slide 壓迫病灶產生 yellowish hue</mark></td><td><mark data-q="105-35">Granulomatous processes</mark></td></tr>
<tr><td>Asboe–Hansen sign</td><td>向下壓迫使 blister 側向擴展</td><td>Pathology 位於 basement membrane zone 以上的水疱病</td></tr>
<tr><td>Auspitz sign</td><td>用力移除 psoriatic plaque 表層鱗屑後，破裂微血管頂端 pinpoint bleeding</td><td>對 psoriasis <strong>not entirely sensitive or specific</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="105-35">Buttonhole sign</mark></td><td>膚色、柔軟的 papule，按壓時好像能經「buttonhole」推入皮膚</td><td><mark data-q="105-35">Neurofibroma</mark></td></tr>
<tr><td>Carpet tack sign</td><td>移除的鱗屑底面有 horny plugs</td><td>Chronic cutaneous lupus 的病灶</td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="108-44">Darier sign</mark></td><td>以手指或筆的圓端用力搓病灶後產生 urticarial wheal，嚴格局限在病灶邊界內；<mark data-q="108-44">wheal may not appear for several minutes</mark></td><td>Urticaria pigmentosa；rarely 見於 cutaneous lymphoma 或 histiocytosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dermatographism</td><td>用力劃過正常皮膚，within seconds to minutes 沿劃痕出現 wheal</td><td>Symptomatic dermatographism 屬 physical urticaria</td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="105-35,108-44">Pseudo-Darier sign</mark></td><td><mark data-q="105-35,108-44">搓揉後病灶暫時變硬（transient induration）或 piloerection</mark></td><td><mark data-q="105-35,108-44">Congenital smooth muscle hamartoma</mark></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="105-35">Fitzpatrick（dimple）sign</mark></td><td>以拇指與食指側向擠壓，因表皮與真皮病灶相連（tethering）而凹陷</td><td><mark data-q="105-35">Characteristic of dermatofibroma</mark></td></tr>
<tr><td><mark data-q="105-35,108-44">Nikolsky sign</mark></td><td><mark data-q="108-44">對未起水疱的皮膚施以 lateral pressure，表皮因剪力剝離</mark></td><td><mark data-q="105-35,108-44">Pathology 位於 basement membrane zone 以上的水疱病；relevant entities 包括 pemphigus vulgaris 與 toxic epidermal necrolysis</mark></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 1-6，p.12（其他徵象見各疾病章節）。</p>
<h3>相關章節補充（考題組合選項依據）</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="105-35">Sarcoidosis：papular form 的 papules often 呈 translucent red-brown 或 yellow-brown；yellow-brown 色似「apple jelly」，以 glass slide 壓迫（diascopy）時更明顯</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.572（ch35）</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="105-35">Bullous pemphigoid：Nikolsky 與 Asboe-Hansen signs 均為 negative</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.944（ch54）</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-44">TEN：Nikolsky sign（以 lateral pressure 使表皮脫落）在 erythematous zones 為 positive</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.736（ch44）</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="105-35,108-44">Congenital smooth muscle hamartoma：病灶內 may 可見 small papules，搓揉後對 transient piloerection 敏感（pseudo-Darier sign）</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2141（ch121）</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-44">Darier sign 在 childhood UP 與 mastocytomas readily demonstrated，但成人病灶 often less pronounced</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.713（ch42）</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-44">Trousseau syndrome 最初指合併 underlying gastric cancer 的 migratory thrombophlebitis，後來擴大為 cancer-associated hypercoagulability（含 superficial migratory thrombophlebitis、DVT 等）</mark>；<span class="ex-ref">p.2460（ch134）</span><mark data-q="108-44">Table 134-1 列出 Trousseau syndrome 的 major internal malignancy 為 pancreatic、brain、lung CA</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.2443（ch134）</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="108-44">Adamantiades–Behçet disease：superficial thrombophlebitis 是發生 systemic vessel involvement 的 risk factor 之一</mark>（課本未把 Behçet 的表淺靜脈炎稱為 Trousseau sign）。<span class="ex-ref">p.2574（ch141）</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Buttonhole sign 對應 neurofibroma；dimple（Fitzpatrick）sign 是 dermatofibroma 的特徵。<span class="ex-ref">p.12</span>Nikolsky sign 見於 pathology 位於 basement membrane zone 以上的水疱病（pemphigus vulgaris、TEN）<span class="ex-ref">p.12</span>；bullous pemphigoid 的 Nikolsky 與 Asboe-Hansen signs 為 negative。<span class="ex-ref">p.944（ch54）</span>Darier sign 的 wheal may not appear for several minutes<span class="ex-ref">p.12</span>，但成人皮膚病灶 often less pronounced。<span class="ex-ref">p.713（ch42）</span>Pseudo-Darier sign（smooth muscle hamartoma）與 Darier sign（urticaria pigmentosa）是不同徵象。<span class="ex-ref">p.12</span></aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="reaction-patterns-surface">
<h2>8. Reaction Patterns with Surface Change（有表面變化的反應模式）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Reaction pattern：primary morphology 與 secondary change（或其缺乏）的組合，決定一個診斷類別，進而聚焦鑑別診斷；在沒有特徵性 shape、configuration、distribution 時 especially useful，也有助於 workup（Tables 1-7 到 1-15）與初始治療。<span class="ex-ref">p.4、p.12</span></li>
<li>第一步是辨認 primary lesion；generalized 或混合型態時，到較大病灶或病灶群的 <strong>edge</strong> 判斷 primary morphology；some diseases 可落在一個以上的 reaction pattern。<span class="ex-ref">p.13</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Pattern</th><th scope="col">Features（特徵）</th><th scope="col">Common examples（例子，節錄）</th><th scope="col">Toolbox（節錄）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Papulosquamous</td><td>相對薄或 flat-topped 的 papule／plaque 帶 scale；crust 或 lichenification usually not present；病理在 epidermis 與 superficial 到 mid-dermis；typically well demarcated，often 病灶之間有正常皮膚</td><td>Psoriasis、lichen planus、pityriasis rosea、PRP、PLC、secondary syphilis、MF/parapsoriasis、drug、SCLE/DLE、dermatomyositis、tinea corporis/versicolor、seborrheic dermatitis、porokeratosis、superficial BCC、SCC in situ</td><td>KOH、fungal culture、RPR、biopsy</td></tr>
<tr><td>Eczematous</td><td>薄的紅色 papules/plaques 加表皮變化；acute 有 spongiosis 造成 serous crusting、microvesicles、sometimes frank bullae；subacute 到 chronic often dry、scaly、fissured、lichenified；typically ill demarcated；因 most 共享相同病理，distribution 與 history 是區分關鍵</td><td>Atopic、irritant／allergic contact、nummular、dyshidrotic、stasis、seborrheic 等；mimickers：scabies、tinea、some blistering disorders（BP、DH）、MF、PMLE</td><td>Patch testing、scraping（scabies、KOH）、biopsy 與 DIF、bacterial／HSV culture（if superinfection suspected）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Vesiculobullous</td><td>水疱全破時要辨認其「footprints」：塌陷後 often 留下 round、oval、arcuate 或 geographic erosions／crusts；HSV 成群小水疱破後形成 scalloped edges 的 crust；「mauserung」desquamation；深層水疱癒合可留 milia</td><td>Pustules（psoriasis、AGEP、IgA pemphigus、candida、impetigo 等）；vesicles/bullae（ACD、HSV/VZV、autoimmune／inherited blistering diseases、PCT 等）；secondary（FDE、EM、SJS/TEN、neutrophilic dermatoses 等）</td><td>KOH／fungal culture 取 blister roof 或 pustule；bacterial culture 取 blister fluid；DFA、viral culture 取 blister base；biopsy、DIF、tissue culture</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dermal「plus」</td><td>真皮浸潤的 papules、nodules、plaques 加表面變化（hyperkeratotic scale、crust、vesicles、pustules、erosion、ulceration）</td><td>Infections（mycobacteria、deep fungal、leishmaniasis 等）、neoplasias（KS、SCC、BCC、Merkel cell carcinoma 等）、inflammatory（Sweet、PG、lymphoma、sarcoidosis、PAN 等）</td><td>Surface culture、biopsy 做病理與 tissue culture</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.13–14；Tables 1-7、1-8、1-9、1-10，p.12–14。</p>
<ul>
<li>難以歸類為 papulosquamous、eczematous 或 vesiculobullous 本身就提示一組鑑別診斷，例如 scabies、acantholytic diseases（Grover、Darier disease）、some drug eruptions、some「id」reactions、some paraneoplastic conditions。<span class="ex-ref">p.14</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="reaction-patterns-no-surface">
<h2>9. Reaction Patterns without Surface Change（無表面變化的反應模式）</h2>
<p>沒有表面變化時，表皮與其 melanin 未改變，often 由 color 與 topography 決定；shape、configuration、distribution 也有幫助。<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Macular</strong>：顏色變化可來自 epidermis 或 dermis（Table 1-11：pink、red、brown、white、gray/blue 分組；toolbox 含 Wood lamp、KOH for tinea versicolor）。<span class="ex-ref">p.14–15</span></li>
<li><strong>Dermal</strong>：浸潤在真皮、沒有表面變化的 papule 或 plaque（Table 1-12：inflammatory、infectious、neoplastic、depositional）。<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span></li>
<li><strong>Subcutaneous</strong>：較深的 papule 或 plaque，usually 沒有表面變化，though occasionally 可潰瘍結痂；過程在 subcutis（Table 1-13：erythema nodosum、lupus panniculitis、erythema induratum、lipodermatosclerosis、subcutaneous fat necrosis of the newborn、panniculitis-like CTCL 等）。<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Purpuric（紫斑）</h3>
<ul>
<li>血液滲出到皮膚，壓迫<strong>不褪色</strong>（do not blanch）；顏色可從 true red、red-purple、magenta 到 red-brown（「cayenne pepper」）。<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span></li>
<li>Purpuric macules sometimes 稱 petechiae，purpuric patches sometimes 稱 ecchymoses；數天後的 ecchymosis may appear yellow-green。<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span></li>
<li><strong>Palpable purpura</strong>（purpuric papules）typically 代表伴出血的小血管發炎（leukocytoclastic vasculitis）、影響小血管的 coagulopathy（cryoglobulinemia）或 very small emboli。<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span></li>
<li>Purpuric plaques 代表 ischemia、embolism、infarction、intravascular infection 或 small-medium／medium vessels 發炎，may 導致表皮壞死；可表現為 pink papules（usually medium vessels）或 stellate dark purple plaques，may 伴 retiform hyperemia（livedo）；表皮壞死時可形成 bullae、ulcer、eschar。<span class="ex-ref">p.15–16</span></li>
<li>Table 1-14 分組：vasculitis（small vessel、medium vessel）、infectious（meningococcemia、purpura fulminans、ecthyma gangrenosum 等）、embolic、vasculopathy（calciphylaxis、cryoglobulin、APS、livedoid vasculopathy 等）、other；toolbox 含 biopsy for histology、DIF、tissue culture。<span class="ex-ref">p.16</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Erythemas（紅斑）</h3>
<ul>
<li>壓迫<strong>會褪色</strong>（blanching）的紅粉色 macules、patches、papules 或 plaques，usually 沒有表面變化；may be subdivided 為四類（Table 1-15）：<span class="ex-ref">p.16</span></li>
<li><strong>Morbilliform</strong>：exanthems，typically 為瀰漫對稱的 pink、red 或 magenta macules 與 papules（viral；bacterial 如 toxic shock syndrome、scarlet fever、meningococcus、mycoplasma；drug 如 morbilliform eruption、DIHS；GVHD、Kawasaki disease、miliaria rubra）。</li>
<li><strong>Figurate</strong>：annular、arcuate 或 polycyclic 的 pink 到 red plaques，generally 無表面變化，例外是 erythema annulare centrifugum 的 prototypical「trailing scale」（Table 1-15 例子：erythema annulare centrifugum、deep gyrate erythemas、erythema migrans、erythema marginatum）。</li>
<li><strong>Urticarial</strong>：pink blanching 病灶，often 呈「wheal and flare」（Table 1-15 例子：urticaria、neutrophilic urticaria、papular urticaria、urticarial vasculitis、dermal hypersensitivity reaction、polymorphous eruption of pregnancy、urticarial bullous pemphigoid、acute hemorrhagic edema of childhood）。</li>
<li><strong>Targetoid</strong>：at least 2 zones，中央較深；中央 often 呈 dusky（gray-violet），owing to epidermal necrosis，或在壞死表皮脫離時起水疱（EM、Mycoplasma-induced rash and mucositis、FDE、urticarial vasculitis、paraneoplastic pemphigus、Rowell-type lupus）。<span class="ex-ref">p.16</span></li>
</ul>
<p class="ex-cite">Tables 1-11 至 1-15，p.14–16。</p>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>Purpura 因紅血球已滲出，壓迫不褪色<span class="ex-ref">p.15</span>；erythemas 則是 blanching。<span class="ex-ref">p.16</span></aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="histopathology">
<h2>10. Histopathologic Correlation（McKee 補充）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Pemphigus vulgaris：摩擦鄰近看似正常的皮膚可誘發水疱（Nikolsky sign）；直接壓迫水疱中央會側向擴展（Asboe-Hansen sign）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.171</span></li>
<li>TEN：Nikolsky sign positive。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.267</span></li>
<li>Bullous pemphigoid：Nikolsky sign usually negative；<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.135</span>mucous membrane pemphigoid 的皮膚病灶（tense bullae）Nikolsky sign 為 negative。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.152</span></li>
<li>Mastocytosis：皮膚中 mast cell degranulation 也造成常見的（common presence）pruritus、positive Darier sign 與 dermographism；Darier sign 指搓病灶後出現局部腫脹或 urticaria，may reach bullous proportions；maculopapular cutaneous mastocytosis 的 Darier sign characteristically positive。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.1516</span></li>
<li>Congenital smooth muscle hamartoma：pseudo-Darier sign can rarely be elicited；one case 以 myokymia（pseudo-Darier sign）為表現。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.1813</span></li>
<li>DLE：移除鱗屑時 horny plugs often 附著於其底面（「carpet tacks」sign）。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.771</span></li>
<li>Lupus vulgaris：gelatinous consistency 的病灶，said with diascopy to resemble apple jelly。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.883</span></li>
<li>Psoriasis：以指甲刮除 parakeratotic scales 後 may 出現小血滴（Auspitz sign），McKee 寫「this is diagnostic」。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.223</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>兩書對 Auspitz sign 說法不同：Fitzpatrick 寫 not entirely sensitive or specific for psoriasis<span class="ex-ref">p.12</span>；McKee 寫 this is diagnostic。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.223</span>BP 的 Nikolsky sign：Fitzpatrick 寫 negative<span class="ex-ref">p.944（ch54）</span>，McKee 寫 usually negative。<span class="ex-ref ex-ref-mckee">McKee p.135</span></aside>
</section>
